# Ba Sing Se: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." Bot1's only other land is a Tundra (the Plains
# and Island types, but not basic, CR 205.4a), so its Ba Sing Se enters tapped; Bot2's own Ba Sing Se beside its Forest
# (basic) enters untapped, the positive control (the same land, the same game).

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Ba Sing Se
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Ba Sing Se
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ba Sing Se.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ba Sing Se.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ba Sing Se.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ba Sing Se.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ba Sing Se.Types = Land
